# What must not enter this image's build context.
#
# The context is services/db, so this file has to live here -- Docker reads
# .dockerignore from the context root and nowhere else, which is why it is one
# of the few files not consolidated at the repository root.
#
# This service's Dockerfile ends in `COPY . /app`, so anything left in the
# directory ships. That makes the backfill's working directories the entry that
# matters most: a full r/PESU dump is large, and it is r/PESU's content rather
# than ours.

# Secrets. The documented .env lives at the repository root, outside this
# context, but a stray one here would otherwise be COPYed into the image.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# Backfill input and output. Created by scripts/, never part of the service.
processed_data/
completed/
*.jsonl
missing_points.json

# Python bytecode, caches, editor and VCS state.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/
.git/
.gitignore
.vscode/
.idea/
